ands|hand]] [[were|be]] [[still]]. \`[[I]] [[only]] [[wanted|want]] [[unity]],\` [[she]] [[told|tell]] [[the]] [[photo]] [[of]] [[her]] [[parents|parent]]. \`[[This]] [[night]] [[was|be]] [[made|make]] [[to]] [[unite]] [[us]]. [[If]] [[I]] [[had|have]] [[welcomed|welcome]] [[one]] pumpkin, [[would]] [[we]] [[have]] [[two]] [[lists|list]] [[now]]? [[Have]] [[I]] [[become]] [[a]] [[slave]] [[to]] [[my]] [[own]] [[tradition]]?\` [[Outside]], Ngoc [[stood|stand]] [[between]] [[the]] [[two]] [[lists|list]] [[with]] [[a]] [[pen]] [[in]] [[her]] [[hand]]. [[In]] [[a]] [[few]] [[days|day]], Lotus Street [[would]] [[celebrate]] [[the]] [[full]] [[moon]] [[twice]], [[and]] [[only]] [[half]] [[as]] [[well]] [[each]] [[time]].`,`vn`:`T\u1ed1i h\u00f4m \u1ea5y b\u00e0 T\u01b0 ng\u1ed3i m\u1ed9t m\u00ecnh gi\u1eefa nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u00e8n l\u1ed3ng. Ai c\u0169ng bi\u1ebft tinh th\u1ea7n l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a b\u00e0: su\u1ed1t b\u1ed1n m\u01b0\u01a1i n\u0103m b\u00e0 ch\u01b0a b\u1ecf m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y n\u00e0o. T\u1ed1i nay \u0111\u00f4i tay b\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 y\u00ean. \`Con ch\u1ec9 mu\u1ed1n c\u1ea3 ph\u1ed1 \u0111o\u00e0n k\u1ebft th\u00f4i,\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i v\u1edbi t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh b\u1ed1 m\u1eb9. \`\u0110\u00eam n\u00e0y sinh ra l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eafn k\u1ebft m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi. Gi\u00e1 m\u00e0 con \u0111\u00f3n nh\u1eadn m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 b\u00ed ng\u00f4, th\u00ec gi\u1edd c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ebfn n\u1ed7i th\u00e0nh hai t\u1edd danh s\u00e1ch kh\u00f4ng? Hay l\u00e0 con \u0111\u00e3 th\u00e0nh n\u00f4 l\u1ec7 cho ch\u00ednh truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh?\` Ngo\u00e0i c\u1eeda, Ng\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ee9ng gi\u1eefa hai t\u1edd danh s\u00e1ch, tay c\u1ea7m m\u1ed9t c\u00e2y b\u00fat. V\u00e0i ng\u00e0y n\u1eefa, ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen s\u1ebd \u0111\u00f3n tr\u0103ng r\u1eb1m hai l\u1ea7n, m\u00e0 l\u1ea7n n\u00e0o c\u0169ng ch\u1ec9 vui \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ed9t n\u1eeda.`}],`tease`:`Hai \u0111\u00e1m r\u01b0\u1edbc, hai th\u00